    "detailed_description": "Abstract Driver is a 1-person game where you have to move inside a cylindrical space.<br>This game is a dynamic action game in which you have to control the camera to the rhythmic music and score points. If you collect a certain number of points, you get achievements.<br><br><strong>SYNTHWAVE</strong>:<br>Move to the pleasant sounds of synthwave along the endless tube<br><br><strong>OBSTACLES:</strong><br>Circumnavigate obstacles that meet on your way. A collision with an obstacle will end your path.<br><br><strong>MODES:</strong><br>Change game modes with the number keys on your keyboard. You can speed up, slow down, change the type of space.<br><br><strong>GAME FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Different types of obstacles<br></li><li>Variety of game modes<br></li><li>Speedy action movement for reaction<br></li><li>Stunning soundtrack</li></ul>",
